 "remarks": "Welcome to Ettl Park, a coveted enclave of townhomes tucked away in a peaceful Glenville setting. This spacious 3Bd/3.5Bth residence combines the ease of condominium living with the scale, comfort and privacy of a home. Beautifully maintained and thoughtfully updated, the residence features a renovated kitchen with custom cabinetry and premium appliances, complemented by an expansive open floor plan with inviting living and dining spaces. The living room showcases a fireplace with a beautifully crafted custom surround and opens to a generously sized private balcony-an inviting spot for morning coffee, outdoor dining or simply relaxing. Upstairs, the primary suite is a serene retreat with custom closets and a beautifully renovated bath. Two additional bedrooms and an updated hall bath complete the upper levels. The versatile floor plan continues on the lower level with a spacious family room featuring a second fireplace and handsome custom built-ins, along with flexible space for a home office, guests, or recreation. Sliding glass doors open directly to a private patio, creating a seamless connection to the outdoors, while a full bath and laundry area add convenience. Offering generous proportions, stylish updates, and wonderful indoor-outdoor living, this Greenwich gem combines the comfort of a private home with the ease of condominium living.",
